    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>geographic-distribution-mean-sums-partial · 4×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 1024 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-geographic-distribution-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"61\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"3\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-geographic-distribution-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const positionsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; positions: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const parametersOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; parameters: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const weightsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; weights: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const partialSumsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; partialSums: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const partialCountsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; partialCounts: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const PI: f32 = 3.14159265358979;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const HALF_PI: f32 = 1.57079632679490;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const TWO_PI: f32 = 6.28318530717959;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">// Bit test: NaN and infinity have an all-ones exponent, and a float comparison may be folded away.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">fn getQuietNaN(seed: u32) -&gt; f32 { return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (seed &amp; 0u)); }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">struct RowData {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  group: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  weight: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  x: f32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  y: f32\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">// An excluded row has group NO_GROUP (and weight 0); x and y are relative to the local origin.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">fn loadRow(row: u32) -&gt; RowData {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  var data = RowData(0xffffffffu, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  let x = positions[positionsOffset + row * 2u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  let y = positions[positionsOffset + row * 2u + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  var valid = isFiniteValue(x) &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(y);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  var weight = 1.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  weight = weights[weightsOffset + row]; valid = valid &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(weight) &amp;&amp; weight &gt; 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  var group = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  if (valid) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    data = RowData(group, weight, x - parameters[parametersOffset], y - parameters[parametersOffset + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  return data;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">const GROUP_COUNT: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">const NO_GROUP: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">const ROWS: u32 = 791u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">const CHUNK_SIZE: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">const CHUNK_COUNT: u32 = 4u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">const TILE_COUNT: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">const SLICES: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">const LANES: u32 = 64u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileGroups: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileValues: array&lt;f32, 768&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; laneSums: array&lt;f32, 768&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; laneCounts: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"63\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"64\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">  _ = &amp;positions;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">  _ = &amp;parameters;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">  _ = &amp;weights;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">  _ = &amp;partialSums;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">  _ = &amp;partialCounts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">  let chunk = index / 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">  let begin = chunk * CHUNK_SIZE;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">  let end = min(begin + CHUNK_SIZE, ROWS);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">  let laneGroup = lane % GROUP_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">  let laneSlice = lane / GROUP_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">  var sum0 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">  var sum1 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">  var sum2 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">  var count = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">  for (var tile = 0u; tile &lt; TILE_COUNT; tile++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">    let row = begin + tile * 256u + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">    var group = NO_GROUP;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    var value0 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    var value1 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    var value2 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    if (row &lt; end) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      let data = loadRow(row);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">      group = data.group;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">      value0 = data.weight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">      value1 = data.weight * data.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">      value2 = data.weight * data.y;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">    if (group &gt;= GROUP_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">      group = NO_GROUP;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">    tileGroups[lane] = group;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">    tileValues[0u + lane] = value0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">    tileValues[256u + lane] = value1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">    tileValues[512u + lane] = value2;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">    if (lane &lt; LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">      // Lane (slice, group) owns tile entries slice, slice + SLICES, ...: a fixed order.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">      for (var entry = laneSlice; entry &lt; 256u; entry += SLICES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">        if (tileGroups[entry] == laneGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">          count++;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">          sum0 += tileValues[0u + entry];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">          sum1 += tileValues[256u + entry];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">          sum2 += tileValues[512u + entry];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  laneSums[0u + lane] = sum0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  laneSums[256u + lane] = sum1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">  laneSums[512u + lane] = sum2;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">  laneCounts[lane] = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">  if (lane &lt; GROUP_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">    var chunkCountTotal = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">    var chunkSum0 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">    var chunkSum1 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">    var chunkSum2 = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">    for (var slice = 0u; slice &lt; SLICES; slice++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">      chunkCountTotal += laneCounts[slice * GROUP_COUNT + lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">      chunkSum0 += laneSums[0u + slice * GROUP_COUNT + lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">      chunkSum1 += laneSums[256u + slice * GROUP_COUNT + lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">      chunkSum2 += laneSums[512u + slice * GROUP_COUNT + lane];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">    partialSums[partialSumsOffset + (0u * GROUP_COUNT + lane) * CHUNK_COUNT + chunk] = chunkSum0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">    partialSums[partialSumsOffset + (1u * GROUP_COUNT + lane) * CHUNK_COUNT + chunk] = chunkSum1;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">    partialSums[partialSumsOffset + (2u * GROUP_COUNT + lane) * CHUNK_COUNT + chunk] = chunkSum2;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">    partialCounts[partialCountsOffset + lane * CHUNK_COUNT + chunk] = chunkCountTotal;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>positions<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"positions\">positions</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>parameters<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parameters\">parameters</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>weights<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"weights\">weights</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>partialSums<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"geographic-distribution-mean-sums-partial-sums\">geographic-distribution-mean-sums-partial-sums</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>partialCounts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"geographic-distribution-mean-sums-partial-counts\">geographic-distribution-mean-sums-partial-counts</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUGeographicDistribution/grouped-partial · main · d57d195d</figcaption></figure></section>",
